              "The Chinese \"strongly urge the US side to immediately correct its mistake, withdraw its arrest warrant for Ms. Meng Wanzhou, and refrain from making formal extradition request to the Canadian side,\" Hua said.\n\nThe Times highlighted that an extradition request would come amid the US-China trade dispute and ahead of talks between Beijing and Washington set for next week, led on the US side by Trade Representative Robert Lighthizer, a noted China hawk",
